.SH NAME
SystemEx.IValueReader \- Provides endian-aware read operations for primitive numeric types\&. Implementations convert the underlying byte sequence into the requested value using the specified \fBEndian\fP format\&. If insufficient bytes are available, the provided fallback value is returned\&.  

